[h2]Build 0.9.30[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]A Loader with nothing to send now lists several different items in its storage with the reason each is not being sent - for example "Quiver - industrial repair center: no bill takes it", or that the machine would take it but already has enough on its way - instead of explaining only the first item on the shelf. It checks every machine on its belt that judges items (such as the SloppyMods repair center), not just the first one.
[/list]
